1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,070
If you have a big belly and you want a flat stomach with visible abs, this video is for you.

2
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:08,370
Here's the truth nobody tells you.

3
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:10,660
You can't crunch your belly away.

4
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:14,160
Doing a thousand sit-ups won't burn the fat on your stomach.

5
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,400
Your abs are already there.

6
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:18,770
They're just hiding under a layer of fat.

7
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:21,670
So to see them, you need to do two things.

8
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:23,330
Lose the fat on top.

9
00:00:23,630 --> 00:00:25,260
And build the muscle underneath.

10
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,760
Let's start with the fat.

11
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:29,700
Step one. Eat a little less than you burn.

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,150
Not a crazy diet.

13
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:34,860
Just remove around three hundred to five hundred calories a day.

14
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:38,470
Cut the sugary drinks, the snacks and the late night food.

15
00:00:38,770 --> 00:00:41,030
That alone can change your whole body.

16
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:43,470
Step two. Eat more protein.

17
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:46,490
Chicken, eggs, fish, greek yogurt.

18
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:50,990
Protein keeps you full, and it protects your muscle while you lose fat.

19
00:00:51,290 --> 00:00:53,990
Step three. Walk every single day.

20
00:00:54,290 --> 00:00:55,930
Eight to ten thousand steps.

21
00:00:56,230 --> 00:01:01,190
It sounds too simple, but walking burns more fat over a week than most people think.

22
00:01:01,490 --> 00:01:02,660
Now, the abs.

23
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:05,010
Your abs are a muscle like any other.

24
00:01:05,310 --> 00:01:07,860
To make them show, you need to make them thicker.

25
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:10,580
And for that, three exercises are enough.

26
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,950
Number one. Hanging leg raises.

27
00:01:13,250 --> 00:01:15,160
Hang from a bar with your arms straight.

28
00:01:15,460 --> 00:01:17,880
Lift your legs up slowly, without swinging.

29
00:01:18,180 --> 00:01:19,880
Then lower them with control.

30
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:21,950
Three sets of eight to twelve.

31
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:23,040
No bar at home?

32
00:01:23,340 --> 00:01:24,700
Do lying leg raises.

33
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,110
Lie on your back, hands under your hips.

34
00:01:27,410 --> 00:01:32,040
Lift your legs up to the ceiling, then lower them slowly, without touching the floor.

35
00:01:32,340 --> 00:01:34,360
Three sets of twelve to fifteen.

36
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:36,230
Number two. The crunch.

37
00:01:36,530 --> 00:01:37,470
But done right.

38
00:01:37,770 --> 00:01:39,610
Lie on your back with your knees bent.

39
00:01:39,910 --> 00:01:44,790
Curl your shoulders up toward your hips, and squeeze your abs for one second at the top.

40
00:01:45,090 --> 00:01:46,190
Don't pull on your neck.

41
00:01:46,490 --> 00:01:49,800
It's a small movement, but it's the one that builds the six-pack.

42
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:51,560
Three sets of fifteen.

43
00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:53,380
Number three. The plank.

44
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:56,960
Elbows under your shoulders, body in one straight line.

45
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:59,190
Squeeze your abs and your glutes.

46
00:01:59,490 --> 00:02:01,560
Hold for thirty to sixty seconds.

47
00:02:01,860 --> 00:02:06,180
This builds the deep muscle that pulls your stomach in and makes it look flat.

48
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,220
Three rounds.

49
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:10,290
Now, three mistakes that keep your belly big.

50
00:02:10,590 --> 00:02:15,730
One. Only doing abs. Without the diet and the walking, the fat stays.

51
00:02:16,030 --> 00:02:21,160
Two. Training abs every day. They need rest to grow, like every other muscle.

52
00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:27,710
Three. Giving up after two weeks. Fat loss is slow at the start, then everything changes.

53
00:02:28,010 --> 00:02:28,730
Here's your plan.

54
00:02:29,030 --> 00:02:32,590
Every day, walk and eat a little less, with more protein.

55
00:02:32,890 --> 00:02:36,100
Three times a week, leg raises, crunches and planks.

56
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,290
Three sets each.

57
00:02:37,590 --> 00:02:38,980
Do this for three months.

58
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:39,980
Look in the mirror.

59
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:43,530
Your belly will be flatter. And your abs will start to show.

60
00:02:43,830 --> 00:02:49,190
Now, once your belly is flat, there's one thing that makes your whole body look complete.

61
00:02:49,490 --> 00:02:50,940
A strong chest.

62
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,640
So watch this video next.

63
00:02:52,940 --> 00:02:58,290
It shows you the three parts of your chest, and how to build each one, at the gym or at home.

64
00:02:58,590 --> 00:03:00,180
And subscribe to Linework Fit.

65
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:03,490
A new video comes out every Tuesday and Saturday.
